# Private documents, by name and in any letter case. This only keeps them out of `git add`; tools/privacy_guard.py is the
# enforcement. The negated lines keep ordinary English words that happen to contain the same letters.
*[Tt][Hh][Ee][Ss][Ii][Ss]*
!*[Pp]arenthesis*
!*[Hh]ypothesis*
!*[Ss]ynthesis*
*[Mm][Aa][Ss][Tt][Ee][Rr][Aa][Rr][Bb][Ee][Ii][Tt]*
*.local.*

target/
refs/
*.fmt
/.rstex-cache/
tests/cd/2[12]-*.tex
__pycache__/
/refs
.claude/
